          <span id="portfolio-reputation-badge" class="px-2.5 py-1 rounded-full text-[10px] font-mono font-bold uppercase bg-red-100 text-red-700 dark:bg-red-950/60 dark:text-red-300 border border-red-200 dark:border-red-900">
            BURNER DEVELOPER RING
